<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span><span id="A6.T8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Generation efficiency on LM1B at 128 NFEs.</span>
